   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Intro - Countdown**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Spooky**: back after 323 archived shows (6966 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n- **Friends Again**: back after 197 archived shows (4572 days); rare: 5 archived performances [5]\n- **Season of the Witch**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2022-10-29.mk4v** (recommended): source not stated; 25 songs; 168 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]\n- **mmj2022-10-29.mk41.flac24**: source not stated; 25 songs; 171 min [2]. Said about its sound: Total runtime is listed as two hours and fifty minutes [2]\n- **mmj2022-10-29**: source not stated; 24 songs; 168 min [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2022-10-29.mk4v**: taped by Brent Stober; transferred by Brent Stober; source: Schoeps mk4v > kc5 > cmc6 > Sound Device Mix Pre 6 [1]\n- **mmj2022-10-29.mk41.flac24**: taped by Brian Porter; source: Schoeps mk41 (FOB/DINa) > kcy > Sonosax SX-M2/LS2 > Sony M10 (24/48) [2]\n- **mmj2022-10-29**: taped by John Haskins (aka Mr. White/Darkstarflashes); source: Tascam DR 40X [3]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by KFC Yum! Center: [My Morning Jacket | KFC Yum! Center](https://www.kfcyumcenter.com/events/detail/my-morning-jacket-yum-22) [6]\n- Fan art by Tony Vasquez: [My Morning Jacket Celebrate Halloween at KFC Yum! Center](https://jamsplus.com/my-morning-jacket-celebrate-halloween-at-kfc-yum-center/) [7]\n- Fan art by Tony Vasquez: [My Morning Jacket Celebrate Halloween at KFC Yum! Center](https://jamsplus.com/my-morning-jacket-celebrate-halloween-at-kfc-yum-center/) [8]\n- Poster by KFC Yum! Center: [My Morning Jacket | KFC Yum! Center](https://www.kfcyumcenter.com/events/detail/my-morning-jacket-yum-22) [9]\n- Fan art by Tony Vasquez: [My Morning Jacket Celebrate Halloween at KFC Yum! Center](https://jamsplus.com/my-morning-jacket-celebrate-halloween-at-kfc-yum-center/) [10]\n- Fan art by Tony Vasquez: [My Morning Jacket Celebrate Halloween at KFC Yum! Center](https://jamsplus.com/my-morning-jacket-celebrate-halloween-at-kfc-yum-center/) [11]",
